          "docs": "This endpoint is used to reserve products before purchase.\n\nEach item includes a `ttl` field which indicates the duration for which the item is guaranteed to stay reserved.\nAfter any one item's ttl has lapsed, the basket should be retrieved again before attemping to check out in order to confirm the current status of the items.\n\n**Note:** an associated availability session is required, along with details of the item to be reserved."
        },
