          "docs": "This endpoint is used to convert a basket's reservations into confirmed bookings.\n\nWhen this call is made, items which are `reserved` or `errored` will immediately move to the `booking` state.\nItems in any other state - i.e. those that have have expired, are currently being booked or which have already been booked - will not be acted upon.\n\nBy the time a response is returned, items will have moved to either `booked` or `errored`.\n\nA successful response indicates that all booking operations have "
        },
